//! Shots: camera moves through a trained splat, rendered, regenerated by video models, and handed
//! to Blender. Backend-independent: needs only a splat PLY and the SfM model it was trained from.
//!
//! Artifact assumptions about other crates: a candidate artifact's dir holds a `splat.ply` (or its
//! path is the PLY) and its meta carries `sfm_id`; the sfm artifact dir is a COLMAP dataset dir
//! (`sparse/0/...`, `images/`). Spirula's `scene_transform.json` is read from next to the PLY or
//! its parent when present.

